    {
      "text": "family of Lehi1 travel three days from Jerusalem, 1 Ne. 2:6. three generations to pass away in righteousness after Christ’s visit, 1 Ne. 12:11 (2 Ne. 26:9). three days of darkness sign of Christ’s death, 1 Ne. 19:10 (Hel. 14:20, 27; 3 Ne. 8:3, 23; 10:9). by words of three will the Lord establish his word, 2 Ne. 11:3 (27:12; Ether 5:3–4). Christ to rise from dead after three days, 2 Ne. 25:13 (Mosiah 3:10). Alma2 was racked with torment for three days and nights, Alma 36:10, 16 (38:8). three sons of Pahoran1 contend for judgment-seat, cause three divisions among people, Hel. 1:4. tempest for three hours at Christ’s death, 3 Ne. 8:19. Christ teaches Nephites for three days, 3 Ne. 26:13. Shared fights Coriantumr2 for three days, Ether 13:28. if three witnesses condemn unrepentant transgressor, he should not be numbered among people of Christ, Moro. 6:7.",
